# ==============================================================================
# Workspace-level .dockerignore for knowthankyew multi-repository builds
# Honored by Docker daemon when docker-compose builds with context: ..
# ==============================================================================

**/.git
**/.github
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.mp4
**/*.gif
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/mlflow_data
**/dist
**/artifacts
